1
00:03:49,090 --> 00:03:55,090
Hidden Gems is a tv movie, romance, comedy film directed by Maclain Nelson.

2
00:07:38,181 --> 00:07:44,181
While prepping for her sister’s wedding, Addie loses her
grandmother’s ring in the waters of Hawaii.

3
00:11:27,272 --> 00:11:33,272
She hires dive instructor Jack to search for her lost treasure.

4
00:15:16,363 --> 00:15:22,363
They immediately clash with each other when Addie
insists she go on the pursuit with Jack.

5
00:19:05,454 --> 00:19:11,454
Once they come to an agreement, Jack ends up serving as
Addie’s tour guide of the island’s hidden gems.

6
00:22:54,545 --> 00:23:00,545
Addie, played by Hunter King.

7
00:26:43,636 --> 00:26:49,636
Jack, played by Beau Mirchoff.

8
00:30:32,727 --> 00:30:38,727
Kate, played by Eliza Hayes Maher.

9
00:34:21,818 --> 00:34:27,818
Nathan, played by Jordan Matlock.

10
00:38:10,909 --> 00:38:16,909
Betty, played by Diane Sargent.

11
00:42:00,000 --> 00:42:06,000
Robert, played by Brian Connors.

12
00:45:49,090 --> 00:45:55,090
Uncut Gems  is a 2019 American crime thriller film directed by Josh and
Benny Safdie, who wrote the screenplay with Ronald Bronstein.

13
00:49:38,181 --> 00:49:44,181
The film stars Adam Sandler, LaKeith Stanfield, Julia Fox,
Kevin Garnett, Idina Menzel, and Eric Bogosian.

14
00:53:27,272 --> 00:53:33,272
The film tells the story of Howard Ratner, a Jewish-American jeweler and gambling addict who
must retrieve an expensive gem he purchased in order to pay off his debt.

15
00:57:16,363 --> 00:57:22,363
Filming took place from September to November 2018.

16
01:01:05,454 --> 01:01:11,454
The original score is by Daniel Lopatin.

17
01:04:54,545 --> 01:05:00,545
The film premiered at the 46th Telluride Film Festival on August 30, 2019.

18
01:08:43,636 --> 01:08:49,636
A24 gave it a limited release in the United States on
December 13 and a wide release on December 25.

19
01:12:32,727 --> 01:12:38,727
Uncut Gems was a box-office success and received acclaim, especially for Sandler's
against-type performance, which several reviewers called the best of his career.

20
01:16:21,818 --> 01:16:27,818
The film was chosen by the National Board of Review
as one of the top ten films of 2019.

21
01:20:10,909 --> 01:20:16,909
The tone is lighthearted and emotional.
